11	// This file is the regression net for a dangling symbolic link on a DIRECTORY
12	// component of the registry path. With work/alias pointing at a directory that
13	// does not exist, reading work/alias/batches.json reaches no file the way the
14	// kernel resolves names — the missing target is not a missing registry file,
15	// and a ".." right after the link (work/alias/../batches.json) cannot step
