14	// link. The rule under guard: a save addressed at a link must land in the
15	// file the link points at — the link stays a link to the same target, the
16	// target keeps its permissions, and reads through either path see the same
17	// records — while a link whose target cannot be resolved (dangling or
18	// looping) rejects the operation instead of being treated as a first
19	// registration.
