13	// This file is the regression net for a registry reached through a DIRECTORY
14	// symbolic link followed by "..". With work/alias -> store/child, the user
15	// path work/alias/../batches.json names store/batches.json: the ".." leaves
16	// the directory the link really points at, not the directory holding the
